{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"df421cb2-89e3-4578-8c70-3dc33eb2c699","status":"SUCCESS","response":"## 1. Functionality Understanding Statement (`/functionality-understanding-check`)\n\nIn accordance with [LANGUAGE.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/LANGUAGE.md) and [functional_specification_009.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/functional_specification_009.md), the desired `{functionality}` is to eliminate latent HTML5 canvas repainting and establish immediate, zero-gesture visual synchronization between the GraphRAG query lifecycle and the force-directed blueprint visualizer canvas:\n\n1. **Immediate Reactive Redraw (`Section 4.1`):**\n   - Whenever `activeNodePKs`, `activeEdgeKeys`, or `isIlluminated` changes in [GraphSyncContext.tsx](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx), [`GraphCanvas`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L17-L547) must immediately and autonomously repaint without waiting for user-initiated DOM events (`mousemove`, `mousedown`, `wheel`, or drag).\n   - Active nodes (`activeNodePKs`) must immediately render in gold/amber (`#ffb703` / `CANVAS_PALETTE.accentAmber`) with active radial glow halos (`rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.45)`) and active halo borders (`#f59e0b`), active edges (`activeEdgeKeys`) must render with active stroke contrast (`#fbbf24`) and increased thickness, and active node captions/leader badges must render with elevated contrast.\n2. **Synchronized Viewport Framing (`Section 4.2`):**\n   - Programmatic camera transitions (`frameActiveSubgraph`) must execute in unified synchronization with visual illumination, rendering the active path in its illuminated state across every intermediate animation frame (`350ms` cubic interpolation) and stabilizing on the final bounding frame.\n3. **Responsive De-Illumination (`Section 4.3`):**\n   - Clearing the search/filter, closing the chat inquiry in [`AgentChatDrawer`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/AgentChatDrawer.tsx#L9-L295), or clicking `✕ RESET PATH` in [`FilterToolbar`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/FilterToolbar.tsx#L13-L183) must immediately revert `isIlluminated` to `false` and autonomously repaint the canvas back to baseline blueprint styling.\n4. **Preserved Selection, Hover Continuity, and Edge Cases (`Sections 4.4 \u0026 5`):**\n   - Selected node highlighting (`selectedNode`) and hover inspection (`hoveredNode`) must persist uninterrupted during and after path illumination; rapid successive queries, settled simulation states (`alpha \u003c alphaMin`), empty subgraph responses (`0` active nodes), and canvas resize events must be handled deterministically.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Wayfinder Roadmap, Decision Tickets, and Master Edit Matrix\n\nAll planning artifacts have been authored and locked in `wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/` and recorded in [wayfinder-read-and-plan.txt](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/handoff/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder-read-and-plan.txt):\n\n- **Wayfinder Map:** [map.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/map.md)\n- **Decision Tickets:**\n  - [ticket-001.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/tickets/ticket-001.md) — Decouple D3 Zoom Lifecycle from Render Callback and Enforce Synchronous Reactive Canvas Repaint\n  - [ticket-002.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/tickets/ticket-002.md) — Active Node Amber Fill, Radial Glow Halo, Directional Edge Illumination, and Selection/Hover Continuity\n  - [ticket-003.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/tickets/ticket-003.md) — Synchronized Camera Viewport Framing and Rapid Query Transition Interruption\n  - [ticket-004.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/tickets/ticket-004.md) — Deterministic State Synchronization, Empty Subgraph Guard, Rapid Query Sequencing, and Responsive De-Illumination\n- **Master Component-to-Edit Matrix:** [matrix.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/wayfinder/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/matrix.md)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Documentation Sufficiency Assessment (`/documentation-sufficient?`)\n\n- **Assessment:** **`{sufficient}`**\n- **Rationale:** Every requirement, visual state transition, and edge case in [functional_specification_009.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/functional_specification_009.md) has been traced to verified root causes in [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx), [`GraphSyncContext.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx), and [`AgentChatDrawer.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/AgentChatDrawer.tsx), with exact line ranges, hook dependencies, state contracts, and visual parameters locked across [ticket-001.md](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-2026